      en: ["The estimated bauxite resources amount to approximately 1 billion tonnes.", "The alumina content (Al2O3) reaches peak values of over 50%.", "The project includes a mining permit covering an area of 500 km².", "Minim-Martap is located at an average elevation of 1,100 meters.", "Canyon Resources is a company listed on the Australian Securities Exchange.", "The planned annual production volume is approximately 5 million tonnes."],
